  "semantic_currentness_review": "Root accepts semantic currentness of the selected U11 evidence and the exact 316 ordered inherited requirements for the captured final runtime source, subject to the separately pending isolated restoration and independent whole-Goal completion audit. This decision follows actual product/code, test/oracle and raw-output reviews recorded throughout PLAN/EXPERIMENT_NOTES/EXPERIMENTS, not Sol summaries alone. The 044 source manifest is exactly equal in all 4678 members and bytes to the unchanged-source 043 runtime boundary; there is no product/test/fixture/config delta after the final actor result. Finalization tools and execution documentation are outside that runtime scanner scope and are separately hash-bound and frozen as records.\nThe 20 categories and 33 row supplements in the exact PREDECESSOR_BINDINGS were reviewed against all original ordered IDs/literals and actual changed paths. Inherited algorithm and asset evidence remains scoped to its frozen target and unchanged semantics; U11 adds evidence for changed World entry/catalog sharing, fallible copy/rollback and runtime-fact consumers, actual normal Lab preparation/coverage, independent bounded approval owners, authenticated cache publication/restart, host future/active generation selection and required-mod persistence. A focused U11 probe is not evidence that every old gameplay predicate was rerun. Shared immutable entry storage preserves separately owned mutable battle state, accounts for real capture/copy cost and respects last-owner release. U10 causal/lineage/ancestry/amount/join and other inherited mechanics retain exact original evidence with changed producer-consumer seams supplemented by current selected probes.\nThe actual hostile Staff/Sword workload is legally prepared through returned public targets and readiness. In 040, Staff deals exactly10 HP with the matching actual ability fact; Sword Activate is accepted and the next1ms clock yields typed Evaluate/DivideByZero. Its six content-failure worker envelopes remain distinct from process crash or timeout. In 043, the real normal actor charges via the6000ms pulse, pauses through its ordinary handler, accepts the target/cast/resume and faults on the subsequent scheduled HostTick. Full public before/after changes are only documented first-fault gate projections, while facts/resources and other snapshots are unchanged; this supplements rather than replaces inherited complete private-root rollback evidence. Exact battle_faulted refusal, pinned fault after B Apply, independent B consuming policy777, unrelated actor isolation, original durable bytes/metadata and accepted cache-record preservation, actual deregistration and recreate/Continue were reviewed in source and actual evidence.\nCriterion adoption is not gameplay proof. The current004 owner has actual fresh calibration/adoption for the exact expression and base-policy suites, then actual passed individual/final A/B jobs. Complete plain/instrumented metrics retain their native/allocator/RSS/elapsed meanings and the previously reviewed development v3 budget; no default runtime emergency cap, general hardware guarantee or new optimization claim is inferred. Earlier036 default fresh adoption/A/B/C and both storage tests remain applicable because later changes are expression fixture/test-harness changes with demonstrated product/worker/nonexpression nonimpact. Earlier033 lifecycle/cache success children remain selected under their preserved failed parent. All failed or source-construction parents remain historical, including035,037,038,041;039 direct preflight is supporting provenance only and040 is its unchanged-parent full functional successor.\nSelection follows the revised user instruction for impact-based tests and justified reuse, not a blanket suite rerun. The internal-TP funding limitation of the8/9 deployment probe, public-versus-private atomicity distinction, required-mod versus unsupported-legacy persistence distinction, operation/phase boundaries, development-versus-default profiles and inherited PC/R05 warnings remain explicit. The 30 new sentences,20 integration seams,10 dimensions and3 execution nodes are covered by the selected actual sources/evidence and reviewed mapping, pending mechanical collection consistency and the final independent audit. Prior Complete/High does not itself complete U11.",
